    "Emmer hat einen weichen Kleber: kurz kneten, kurze Gare, am sichersten in der Kastenform backen." : {
      "comment" : "Text for a hint that emmer wheat should be kneaded for a short time and at a short temperature, preferably in a cast-iron pan.",
